          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE 5/343 WESTON TURVILLE WEST END west side No.7 Chandos Cottage GV II Cottage. C17 altered. Timber framed with painted brick infill. Thatched roof, hipped to RH, brick chimney at RH end. 4 eaves dormers. 1 storey and attic. Thatch carried down to form canopy over central door. 3 modern casements to ground floor narrow bay to LH is later addition in colourwashed brick. 1 storey pantiled addition to LH. RCHM I.p.316. MON.16. Listing NGR: SP8522510799"
    }
